er-spacing, beneath it two centered lines of smaller muted silver text reading \"light remembers\" and then \"face as signal\"; overall mood soft fracture, luminous. Panel 2 specification: dark navy to black background; an adult male head and shoulders in three-quarter profile wearing thin metallic sunglasses; a cold electric cobalt light beam rakes across his face from the left while his neck dissolves into horizontal motion-blur streaks; faint scan lines and small technical marks on the right side; at the upper left set a condensed angular cut-corner geometric display title \"BLUE RESIDUE\" in bright cyan with a thin lighter outline, beneath it two lines of smaller cool blue-gray text reading \"vision trace\" and \"held in shadow\", then one line of fainter cyan micro-text reading \"afterimage field\"; mood futuristic cinematic. Panel 3 specification: bright white background; an adult East Asian woman in clean side profile facing right with a smooth continuous dark hair silhouette; three semi-transparent chromatic glitch echo trails in cyan, violet, acid green, and soft red offset behind her as delayed copies of the same face; thin layout grid lines and micro-grid texture along the panel edges; at the upper left set a light-weight geometric display title \"ECHO FRAME\" in charcoal gray with fine spacing, beneath it two lines of small pale gray text reading \"color delay\" and \"synthetic memory\", then one line of tiny acid-green tinted text reading \"motion index\"; mood dreamlike precise. Panel 4 specification: monochrome charcoal background with pale gray dust; an adult shaved-head male facing forward with a razor-sharp upper face while the lower half of his head dissolves into drifting digital ash particles and scan distortion; fine grain, floating dust specks, subtle pale grid overlay; at the top center set a weathered high-contrast display serif title \"SIGNAL ASH\" in washed lavender-gray with eroded fragmenting strokes, beneath it two lines of small pale gray text reading \"blurred identity\" and \"static remains\", then one line of fainter ash-white micro-text reading \"portrait erosion\"; mood cold minimal experimental. Every rendered text element must stay crisp, intentional, and fully legible; each variant keeps its strict palette and its distinct subject; the overall composition remains clean, minimal, spacious, and visually striking with precise editorial typography throughout."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 770, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 499, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [737], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [300, 120], "pos": [332.2272033691406, 3219.244384765625], "widgets_values": [1024, 1024, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 743, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 744, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}], "flags": {}, "id": 482, "type": "EmptyLatentImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.36.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"width": true, "height": true}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyLatentImage"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "width", "links": [743], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [744], "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "size": [300, 190], "pos": [-70.36626434326172, 3279.710693359375], "widgets_values": ["9:16 (Portrait Widescreen)", 2.2, 32], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "preview", "label": "preview", "type": "RESOLUTI