ion layers in highly readable white or theme-derived pale text. Extract the palette from the theme, led by luminous red backlight, transparent black structure, and a small amount of pale text; keep the hierarchy clean and avoid muddy gray-brown, distressed stains, and chaotic gradients. Preserve wide dark breathing room, lightly visible film grain and shadow noise, and sharp edges. The result should feel like a precisely choreographed technology-stage reveal for a product launch or team introduction, with the people decomposed into a rhythmic silhouette matrix and strong information hierarchy. Avoid filling every compartment with detail, readable accidental background text, logos other than the requested label, watermarks, generic corporate stock photography, weak contrast, or clutter."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 497, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "positive", "links": [740], "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "negative", "links": [741], "label": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "negative"}, {"name": "latent", "links": [742], "label": "latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent"}], "size": [541.9922485351562, 446], "pos": [46.406715393066406, 2403.495361328125], "widgets_values": ["The image is a wide hand-drawn charcoal sketch portrait of a young East Asian woman rendered in a rough ink-and-charcoal illustration style, set against a textured off-white paper background with subtle grain and faint tonal variation across its surface. The background is a flat, unbleached cream paper with visible fibre texture, slightly darker at the edges suggesting a scanned or photographed sheet. In the upper-left quadrant, a large handwritten brush-script headline reads \"Still Here\" in thick black strokes, the letters loose and expressive with uneven weight, the word \"Still\" stacked above \"Here\" and a short horizontal dash beneath. Directly below that headline, two lines of small black serif type read \"Same me.\" and \"A quieter day.\" in a lighter, more restrained weight than the brush-script above. The central subject occupies the middle and lower half of the frame: a young woman depicted from the shoulders up, her face turned slightly toward the viewer with a calm, neutral expression. Her hair is rendered in dense, heavy charcoal strokes, long and dark, falling past her shoulders on both sides and parted near the centre of her head, with the texture of individual strokes visible throughout. Her face is left mostly unshaded, the paper white showing through for skin, while her eyes are drawn as small dark ovals with defined brows above them, and her lips are a small dark mark. On the upper-left of her head, a small butterfly-shaped hair clip is suggested with a few delicate lines, echoing the accessory in the source photograph. She wears a scoop-neck top rendered in rough cross-hatched charcoal, the leopard-print pattern suggested through irregular dark spots and patches rather than detailed rendering, the neckline curving low across her chest. A thin gold necklace with a small round pendant hangs at her collarbone, drawn as a fine single line with a tiny circle at its centre. On the right side of the frame, roughly at mid-height, a small black serif label reads \"NO. 01\" with a thin horizontal rule drawn directly beneath it. Below that, in the lower-right area, three short lines of small black serif type read \"Some faces\" \"carry\" \"silent stories.\" stacked vertically with generous leading. The lighting is flat and even across the entire composition, with no cast shadows or highlights, consistent with a hand-drawn illustration on a paper surface where all depth comes from line weight and stroke density rathe